  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Sub-Saharan Transport Policy Program, SSATP, med utf&#xf6;randet av dess andra utvecklingsplan 2008-2011. SSATP best&#xe5;r av 35  medlmesl&#xe4;nder, 8 RECs och ungef&#xe4;r 11 givare, vars m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att underl&#xe4;tta utvecklingen av h&#xe5;llbara transportpolicies och -strategier samt institutionella och financiella reformer inom transportsektor f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja ekonomisk tillv&#xe4;xt och fattidgomsminskning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Sub-Saharan Transport Policy Program, SSATP, in carrying out its Second Development Plan 2008-2011. SSATP is a partnership with 35 member countries, 8 RECs and approx. 11 donors. aiming to facilitate the development of sound transport sector policies and strategies and related institutional and financial reform in support of sust econ growth and poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
